  13:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp **** /*
  14:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp ****  * cJSON_PrintPreallocated() writes directly into this single static response
  15:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp ****  * workspace. The dispatcher is called synchronously from the WebHID service,
  16:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp ****  * which copies the result into its outbound storage before another request is
  17:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp ****  * dispatched. Keeping this buffer out of newlib's 32 KiB heap avoids a second
  18:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_rpc_dispatcher.cpp ****  * near-16 KiB allocation while the command handler's cJSON tree is alive.
